#. Description of the 'PMO — Committed end' (Date) field in DocType 'Project'
#: pmo/fixtures/custom_field.json
msgid "Committed completion date of the project (business or agreed commitment). Different from the Expected End Date, which is the calculated date. It does not shift automatically with the schedule (can be changed manually). It does not block saving; if the calculated end exceeds it, only a warning is shown. Empty = no commitment."
msgstr "Fecha comprometida de terminación del proyecto (compromiso de negocio o acordado). Distinta del Expected End Date, que es la fecha calculada. No se desplaza automáticamente con el cronograma (puede cambiarse manualmente). No bloquea el guardado; si el fin calculado la supera, solo se muestra un aviso. Vacío = sin compromiso."

#: pmo/pmo/report/pmo_status_report/pmo_status_report.py:48
#: pmo/project_control.py:64 pmo/templates/project_control/executive.html:84
msgid "Committed date"
msgstr "Fecha comprometida"

#. Description of the 'PMO — Committed date (deadline)' (Date) field in DocType
#. 'Task'
#: pmo/fixtures/custom_field.json
msgid "Committed/deadline date of the task (business or agreed commitment). Different from the Expected End Date, which is the calculated date. It does not shift automatically with rescheduling (can be changed manually). It does not move the task, block saving, or the actual log; if the planned end exceeds it, only a warning is shown. Empty = no commitment."
msgstr "Fecha comprometida/límite de la tarea (compromiso de negocio o acordado). Distinta del Expected End Date, que es la fecha calculada. No se desplaza automáticamente con la reprogramación (puede cambiarse manualmente). No mueve la tarea ni bloquea el guardado ni el registro real; si el fin planeado la supera, solo se muestra un aviso. Vacío = sin compromiso."

